SUMMARY:MUNA: Gets So Hot Tour
LOCATION:Roadrunner\, 89 Guest St\, Boston\, MA 02135
DESCRIPTION:with hemlocke springs\nMUNA’s journey has always been about b
 ringing to light the complex\, messy\, ecstatic realities of life\, and wi
 th their fourth album\, Dancing On The Wall\, they’ve never been sharper
 \, darker\, or more exhilarating. Emerging from the sparkly\, confetti-str
 ewn heights of their 2022 self-titled record\, MUNA now channel the raw\, 
 anxious\, and sweat-soaked energy of living in a city (Los Angeles) of unr
 elenting heat\, a corrupted world wrought by political tension\, and the q
 uieter and more personal pressures of millennial precarity and heartache i
 n these uncertain times. The result is a record that feels both intimate a
 nd spectacular: a fast-paced\, hard-edged dance pop world built with teeth
 \, wit\, and emotional resonance—a soundtrack for hearts on fire amidst 
 the tumult of modern life.\nhttps://www.axs.com/events/1436208/muna-gets-s
 o-hot-tour-tickets\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.axs.com/events/1436208/muna-gets-so-hot-tour-tickets
END:VEVENT
